    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table style=\"float: right; background-color:Black; width:300px; border: 1px solid #6e0410; font-size:89%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color:#6e0410; color:White; font-size: 130%; padding:15px;\">月光阴影与阳光的丛林\n\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/ce/QBR2.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130516015303\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"QBR2\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/ce/QBR2.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20130516015303\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"421\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"QBR2.jpg\" data-image-key=\"QBR2.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i>汉字'</i></td>\n<td>密林の月影と太陽\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>罗马字</b></td>\n<td>Mitsurin no Tsukikage to Taiyō\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>播出日期</b></td>\n<td>2012年4月17日\n\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color:#6e0410; color:White;\">信息\n\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>片头曲</b></td>\n<td>你能听见生命之歌\n\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>片尾曲</b></td>\n<td>未来是严肃的\n\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color:#6e0410; color:White;\">剧集指南\n\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\" valign=\"top\">\n<td><b>上一个</b><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Holy_Fight\" title=\"Holy Fight\">第34集</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>下一个</b><br /><a href=\"/wiki/The_Unstoppable_Hyper_Vibration\" title=\"The Unstoppable Hyper Vibration\">第36集</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>\"<b>月光阴影与阳光的丛林</b>是……的第三十五集  <a href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Blade\" title=\"Queen&#39;s Blade\">女皇之刃</a>  动画。\n\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Story\">故事</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThe_Jungle_of_Moon_Shadows_and_Sunlight%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>在听说……的浓雾之后  <a href=\"/wiki/Calibara_Forest\" title=\"Calibara Forest\">卡利巴拉森林</a>  阻碍航运，  <a href=\"/wiki/Annelotte\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Annelotte\">安妮洛特</a>  进入森林希望解决问题。在森林里，安妮洛特遇到了卡利巴拉部落，他们带她去找他们最强的战士  <a href=\"/wiki/Luna_Luna\" title=\"Luna Luna\">露娜·露娜</a>  她预见了安妮洛特的到来。以为安妮洛特是她命中注定的丈夫，露娜·露娜把安妮洛特带到部落的历史遗迹去向他们神报告，但安妮洛特透露她是个女人。安妮洛特被带回村庄参加宴会，她喝醉了。第二天，安妮洛特醒来发现自己被锁在监狱里，村长解释说，既然她看到了遗迹，就不能让她离开。露娜·露娜负责看守安妮洛特，但以她顽皮的黑皮肤月之舞者性格，露娜·露娜反而想和安妮洛特亲热。村长发现了并警告露娜·露娜，然后露娜·露娜去睡觉却没有锁牢房门。安妮洛特走了出去，但听说如果她逃跑露娜·露娜会受到惩罚，就自己回到了牢房。\n\n</p><p>露娜·露娜感谢安妮洛特回来，想和她亲热，但长老再次发现并警告露娜·露娜不要再接近安妮洛特，同时给安妮洛特戴上锁链和球。然而，露娜·露娜没有放弃，她变成白皙、天真的阳光舞者人格以规避长老的命令，进入牢房。在里面，露娜·露娜再次变暗，开始用触手抚摸安妮洛特。露娜·露娜随后感到有什么东西在回碰她，但她所感觉到的是正在爬进监狱的巨大蛞蝓的触须。蛞蝓强行闯入牢房，但露娜·露娜用触手将其切开，她和安妮洛特被洒了一身黏液。露娜·露娜跑出去，发现村庄正被邪恶的魔法巨型蛞蝓攻击，她砍杀了一群。\n安妮洛特设法抓住监狱里的钥匙逃脱，跑出去帮忙对抗蛞蝓。蛞蝓撤退后合体成一只巨大的蛞蝓，喷出一直困扰森林的浓雾。露娜·露娜攻击巨型蛞蝓，但被其触须弹开。安妮洛特激活她的特殊能力，骑着她的幻影马冲向蛞蝓。安妮洛特用她变成长矛的剑摧毁了触须，然后跳向蛞蝓。卡利巴拉神像激活，导致安妮洛特失去她的马，但她设法对巨型蛞蝓的脸进行了斩击。遗迹随后激活，吸走了巨型蛞蝓将其永久封印。事件结束后，安妮洛特向村庄告别。回到村庄，露娜·露娜说服长老让她离开村庄去跟随安妮洛特。\n\n</p>\n<table style=\"border: 1px solid #6e0000; width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#6e0000; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><b>季节与集数</b>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"width: 150px; font-size:90%; background-color: #a10000;\">\n<p><b><a href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Blade:_Wandering_Warrior\" title=\"Queen&#39;s Blade: Wandering Warrior\">流浪战士</a></b>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"font-size:90%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/High_Spirits:_The_Wandering_Warrior\" title=\"High Spirits: The Wandering Warrior\">1</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Ambitious_Undertaking:_Warrior_Priestess\" title=\"Ambitious Undertaking: Warrior Priestess\">2</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Charm_Attack:_Veteran_Mercenary\" title=\"Charm Attack: Veteran Mercenary\">3</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Rivalry:_Thundercloud_General\" title=\"Rivalry: Thundercloud General\">4</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Resurrected_Curse:_Ancient_Princess\" title=\"Resurrected Curse: Ancient Princess\">5</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Promise:_Forest_Keeper\" title=\"Promise: Forest Keeper\">6</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Advent:_Angel_of_Light\" title=\"Advent: Angel of Light\">7</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth:_Assassin_of_the_Fang\" title=\"Stealth: Assassin of the Fang\">8</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Sincerity:_The_Weaponsmith_and_the_Steel_Princess\" title=\"Sincerity: The Weaponsmith and the Steel Princess\">9</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Enlightenment:_Blow_of_the_Dragon\" title=\"Enlightenment: Blow of the Dragon\">10</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Thunder:_After_the_Death_Battle\" title=\"Thunder: After the Death Battle\">11</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Final_Destiny:_Path_to_the_Queen\" title=\"Final Destiny: Path to the Queen\">12</a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://queensblade.fandom.com/wiki/Queen&#39;s_Blade_Omake#Queen.27s_Blade:_The_Wandering_Warrior_.28Everybody_Appears_-_Gainos_Academy_Rampage.21.29\">附加内容</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"width: 150px; font-size:90%; background-color: #a10000;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Blade:_Inheritor_of_the_Throne\" title=\"Queen&#39;s Blade: Inheritor of the Throne\">王位继承者</a></b>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"font-size:90%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Assemble:_Queen%27s_Blade\" title=\"Assemble: Queen&#39;s Blade\">1</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Crush_the_Evil:_The_Unforgettable_Battle\" title=\"Crush the Evil: The Unforgettable Battle\">2</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Fiery_Passion:_Ignited_Karma\" title=\"Fiery Passion: Ignited Karma\">3</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Showdown:_The_Voice_of_a_Crucial_Meeting\" title=\"Showdown: The Voice of a Crucial Meeting\">4</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Strategy:_The_Queen%27s_Palace_of_Lament\" title=\"Strategy: The Queen&#39;s Palace of Lament\">5</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Complication:_Changing_Premonition\" title=\"Complication: Changing Premonition\">6</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Freeze:_Appraisal_of_the_Situation\" title=\"Freeze: Appraisal of the Situation\">7</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Disgrace:_The_Battle_Angel\" title=\"Disgrace: The Battle Angel\">8</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Innermost_Feelings:_Showdown_at_Castle_Vance\" title=\"Innermost Feelings: Showdown at Castle Vance\">9</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/A_Cherished_Wish:_What_is_Worth_Fighting_For\" title=\"A Cherished Wish: What is Worth Fighting For\">10</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Duel_to_the_Death:_Culminating_Showdown\" title=\"Duel to the Death: Culminating Showdown\">11</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Ambition:_The_Successor_to_the_Throne\" title=\"Ambition: The Successor to the Throne\">12</a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://queensblade.fandom.com/wiki/Queen&#39;s_Blade_Omake#Queen.27s_Blade:_Inheritor_of_the_Throne_.28Let.27s_Still_Appear_-_Gainos_Academy_Rampage.21.29\">附加内容</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"width: 150px; font-size:90%; background-color: #a10000;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Blade:_Beautiful_Fighters\" title=\"Queen&#39;s Blade: Beautiful Fighters\">美丽战士</a></b>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"font-size:90%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faith:_Elina%27s_Unshakable_Bond\" title=\"Faith: Elina&#39;s Unshakable Bond\">1</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Longing:_Alleyne%27s_Thousand_Year_Separation\" title=\"Longing: Alleyne&#39;s Thousand Year Separation\">2</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Melancholy:_Airi%27s_Double-Cross\" title=\"Melancholy: Airi&#39;s Double-Cros